<html ><head ><meta charset="UTF-8"  /><meta name="author" content="Martin Walther - @tinuwalther"  /><meta name="keywords" content="Pode, PSHTML, PowerShell, Mermaid Diagram"  /><meta name="description" content="Builds beatuifull HTML-Files with PSHTML from native PowerShell-Scripts"  /><link rel="stylesheet" href="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.min.css"  /><link rel="stylesheet" href="\assets\style\style.css"  /><script src="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.bundle.min.js"  ></script><script src="\assets\Chartjs\Chart.bundle.min.js"  ></script><title >#PSXi Pester Result</title><link type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/img/favicon.ico" rel="icon"  /></head><Body ><header ><div Style="padding:15; background-color:#012456" Class="jumbotron text-center" Id="j1"  ><p ><h1 >#PSXi Pester Result</h1></p><p >I ♥ PS Pode > This is an example for using pode and PSHTML, requested by API. The page is 
$(if(Test-Path 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Pester-Result.pode'){
    $($regex = '[0-9]{4}\-[0-9]{2}\-[0-9]{2}\s[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}')
    $($index = Get-Content 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Pester-Result.pode')
    $($created = Get-Date ([regex]::Match($index, $regex).Value))
    $($diffTime = New-TimeSpan -Start $created -End (Get-Date))
    $(if($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 61 -and $diffTime.TotalMinutes -lt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-warning' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-warning' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }elseif($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-danger' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-danger' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }else{
        # $badge = 'badge badge-success' # Bootstrap v4.6.x 
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-success' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    })
    $(span -class $badge {'{0} Days {1} Hours {2} Minutes old' -f $diffTime.Days, $diffTime.Hours, $diffTime.Minutes})
})
</p></div></header><Section Id="section"  ><nav Class="navbar navbar-expand-sm bg-dark navbar-dark sticky-top"  ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><a Target="_self" href="/" Class="navbar-brand"  >»HOME</a><button Class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-target="#collapsibleNavbar" data-bs-toggle="collapse"  ><span Class="navbar-toggler-icon"  ></span></button><div Id="collapsibleNavbar" Class="collapse navbar-collapse"  ><ul Class="navbar-nav"  ><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_blank" href="https://pester.dev/" Class="nav-link"  >Pester</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" href="#PassedTests" Class="nav-link"  >Passed</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" href="#FailedTests" Class="nav-link"  >Failed</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" href="#NotRunTests" Class="nav-link"  >NotRun</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" href="#SkippedTests" Class="nav-link"  >Skipped</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" href="/help" Class="nav-link"  >Help</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><div Id="Content" Class="Container"  ><h1 Style="color:#212529"  >Result of some Pester Tests</h1><p Style="color:#000"  >Based on input admin.ch, sbb.ch</p><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><canvas Id="BarCanvas" Width="800px" Height="300px"  >Canvas not supported in your browser</canvas></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p ></p></div></div></div><script >var ctx = document.getElementById("BarCanvas").getContext('2d'); var myChart = new Chart(ctx, {"type":"bar","data":{"labels":[""],"datasets":[{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"green","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"green","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[6],"label":["Passed"]},{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"red","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"red","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[2],"label":["Failed"]},{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"yellow","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"yellow","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[2],"label":["NotRun"]},{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"blue","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"blue","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[2],"label":["Skipped"]}]},"options":{"barPercentage":1,"categoryPercentage":1,"responsive":false,"barThickness":null,"maxBarThickness":0,"offsetGridLines":true,"scales":{"yAxes":[{"ticks":{"beginAtZero":true}}],"xAxes":[""]},"title":{"display":false,"text":null},"animation":{"onComplete":null}}} );</script><div Id="Content" Class="Container"  ><article Id="pester"  ><h2 Style="color:#212529" Id="PassedTests"  >Passed</h2><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to sbb.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0037617</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to admin.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0245926</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to sbb.ch should return a PSCustomObject</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0036274</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to admin.ch should return a PSCustomObject</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0043537</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetTping to sbb.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0298660</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetTping to admin.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0297371</td></tr></tbody></Table></article><article Id="pester"  ><h2 Style="color:#212529" Id="FailedTests"  >Failed</h2><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th><th >Message</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetWping to sbb.ch should return true</td><td >Failed</td><td >00:00:00.1606765</td><td >Expected $true, but got $false.</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetWping to admin.ch should return true</td><td >Failed</td><td >00:00:00.0812786</td><td >Expected $true, but got $false.</td></tr></tbody></Table></article><article Id="pester"  ><h2 Style="color:#212529" Id="NotRunTests"  >NotRun</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Excluded Tests by Tag name.</p><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetPing to <_> should return true</td><td >NotRun</td><td >00:00:00.0000845</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetPing to <_> should return true</td><td >NotRun</td><td >00:00:00.0000651</td></tr></tbody></Table></article><article Id="pester"  ><h2 Style="color:#212529" Id="SkippedTests"  >Skipped</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Excluded Tests by the skip-parameter.</p><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetUping to <_> should return true</td><td >Skipped</td><td >00:00:00.0004817</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetUping to <_> should return true</td><td >Skipped</td><td >00:00:00.0003963</td></tr></tbody></Table></article></div></Section><pre Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the page: I ♥ PS > Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/pester -Method Post -Body '["sbb.ch","admin.ch"]'</pre></Body><div Style="background-color:#343a40" Class="container-fluid"  ><footer ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Target="_self" href="#" Class="btn-sm btn btn-outline-success"  >I ♥ PS ></a></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p >Based on <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Pode"  >pode</a> and <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PSHTML"  >PSHTML</a></p></div><div Style="color:#000" Class="col-md"  ><p >Created at 2024-08-14 16:47:54</p></div></div></div></footer></div></html>
